#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:2 bdb279678ace4bf783afe48e009f6445
msgid "_`CMakeLists Configuration`"
msgstr "CMakeLists 配置"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:5 5beeefc013a845d980927a6f6b592f25
msgid "_`Overview`"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:7 32b018b548fe4918be72321ea6567a96
msgid ""
"CMakeLists.txt is where the build starts. It reads the package identity "
"and every build switch from metadata.json, collects the sources from "
"include and src, and creates the library targets and their installation "
"rules."
msgstr ""
"构建从 CMakeLists.txt 开始。它从 metadata.json 读入包标识和所有构建开关，从 include 和 src "
"收集源文件，并创建库目标及其安装规则。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:12 ff1c92ccd7534325aa7904138e08ecb5
msgid "_`Key Features`"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:14 196cb6cf5884410a95e569a2707f2722
msgid "Package identity and build switches read from metadata.json"
msgstr "包标识和构建开关都取自 metadata.json"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:15 84d064721bc446e1b522e5c8d1f4f496
msgid "Automatic source collection and target creation"
msgstr "自动收集源文件并创建目标"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:16 06861cfa6c9c4385a2afca88510960a9
msgid ""
"Dependencies wired in through the C_DEPS / CPP_DEPS lists the Conan "
"recipe prepares"
msgstr "依赖通过 Conan 配方生成的 C_DEPS / CPP_DEPS 列表接入"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:17 cc71167a910442918394acb343b130b1
msgid "Optional C++ module support (C++23 and above)"
msgstr "可选的 C++ 模块支持（C++23 及以上）"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:18 72c1c66e2e68449188985ff9adc60e05
msgid "Optional Python bindings module"
msgstr "可选的 Python 绑定模块"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:19 000a2c6b820c4aa4b1597593dd283dfa
msgid "Installation rules for libraries, headers and the CMake package export"
msgstr "库、头文件和 CMake 包导出的安装规则"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:22 e59e7fb3894a4d4eb01f143256557153
msgid "_`Main Configurations`"
msgstr "主要配置"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:24 732423e95a9a4f3fbf627977478c2ae8
msgid ""
"Build switches come from metadata.json instead of being hard-coded: "
"project name, namespace and version, the C and C++ standards, shared or "
"static, header-only mode, the pre-compiled standard modules list, code "
"coverage and the Python bindings switch."
msgstr ""
"构建开关不写死在 CMake 里，而是来自 metadata.json：项目名、命名空间和版本，C 与 C++ "
"标准，静态还是共享，是否仅头文件，预编译标准模块列表，代码覆盖率，以及 Python 绑定开关。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:28 2d2d7f34d630474c97f01704d05060bf
msgid ""
"Sources are collected recursively from include (\\*.h, \\*.hpp) and src "
"(\\*.c, \\*.cpp and the module suffixes \\*.ixx / \\*.cppm). Each glob is"
" anchored to its own directory, so the scan does not pick up api, "
"test_package, benchmark or build."
msgstr ""
"源文件从 include（\\*.h、\\*.hpp）和 src（\\*.c、\\*.cpp 以及模块后缀 \\*.ixx / "
"\\*.cppm）递归收集。每个 glob 都限定了自己的目录，所以不会扫到 api、test_package、benchmark 或 "
"build。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:32 3623213d7132419aad67be2edf04395a
msgid ""
"For a general package it creates food_volume_measure_c and "
"food_volume_measure_cpp, plus an INTERFACE target that links both, so a "
"consumer only has to link food_volume_measure. The language standards are"
" set per target (C11 and C++17 here) with compiler extensions disabled. "
"add_library() does not accept an empty source list, so a generated empty "
"translation unit keeps the C target valid even though this library has no"
" C sources. On Windows a requested shared build falls back to static with"
" a warning."
msgstr ""
"普通包会生成 food_volume_measure_c 和 food_volume_measure_cpp，再加一个把两者都链接进来的 "
"INTERFACE 目标，所以使用者只需要链接 food_volume_measure。语言标准分别设在各自目标上（本库是 C11 和 "
"C++17），并关闭编译器扩展。add_library() 不允许源文件列表为空，因此这里生成一个空的编译单元，让 C 目标始终有效 —— "
"即使本库目前没有 C 源文件。在 Windows 上要求共享库时会退化成静态库并给出警告。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:39 8029abe092b24e01b4d0939198d342ed
msgid ""
"The Conan recipe passes dependencies in as Pkg@Targets pairs. Each pair "
"is split, find_package() is called, and the listed targets are linked "
"into the C or the C++ library."
msgstr ""
"依赖由 Conan 配方以 Pkg@Targets 的形式传入。CMake 会拆开每一项，调用 find_package()，再把列出的目标链接到"
" C 库或 C++ 库。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:42 a421a2a26bc941e598ffeb9b9022b225
msgid ""
"C++ modules are only enabled for C++23 and above; below that the build "
"prints a note saying module support is off. The module file suffix is "
"platform-specific: MSVC uses .ixx and GCC/Clang use .cppm. With the "
"Python bindings switch on, an extra pybind11 module is built from "
"api/python_bindings.cpp and installed next to the libraries."
msgstr ""
"只有 C++23 及以上才会启用 C++ 模块，更低的标准下构建会打印一句提示，说明模块支持已关闭。模块文件后缀随平台不同：MSVC 用 "
".ixx，GCC/Clang 用 .cppm。打开 Python 绑定开关后，会额外用 api/python_bindings.cpp 构建一个 "
"pybind11 模块，和库一起安装。"

